<title>SPAIN: TelePizza 1996 group profit rises 66 pct.</title>
<headline>TelePizza 1996 group profit rises 66 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>TelePizza 1996 group results (in billions of pesetas, unless stated):</p>
<p> Net profit				 1.70    vs   1.02</p>
<p> Turnover				  19.36    vs  14.71</p>
<p>NOTE - TelePizza SA said in a statement it controlled more than 50 percent of the home delivery pizza market with a workforce of 5,372. It started trading on the bourse on November 13, 1996. The statement did not specify whether the results were before or after taxes, but they coincide with the firm's recent forecast for net profit.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2151</p>
</text>
